# Show canonical XML when diffing .vsdx files instead of "Binary files differ",
# and 3-way merge them on their canonical part trees instead of failing as binary.
# Both require a one-time local setup of the driver commands:
#     npm run vsdx:install-difftool
# (git can't ship the commands themselves in .gitattributes for security reasons)
*.vsdx diff=vsdx merge=vsdx
